Name: gts (Google TypeScript Style)
Short Name: gts
URL: https://github.com/google/gts
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Version: 2026.1.0
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/gts
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/gts

Description:
Google's TypeScript style guide, configuration, linter, and automatic code fixer.

Local Modifications:
- Refactored into 100% Native Upstream Bun v1.4.4+ in packages/yolo-bun-plugin (yolo-bun:google-styleguide).
- Enforces no-any, named exports only, no const enum, no namespace, private #fields, and strict ES module imports.
